Set yourself on the road to weight loss with smart fasting, easy calorie and progress tracking and personalized meal plans with Unimeal!

- Intermittent fasting made easy
Customize your fasting plan based on your goals, experience, and lifestyle. Choose the fasting window that works best for you and the plan will adapt;

- Personalized meal plans
Your plan is based on your unique eating preferences and needs. Choose from keto diet to mediterranean — we always make sure your plans works for you;

- Smart AI scanner 
Log your food effortlessly with one tap with the true power of Unimeal’s AI scanner. Scan your meals and get instant nutrition information;

- Easy to use Calorie Tracker
Our calorie and macros tracker helps you stay in control of your nutrition. When you track with ease, staying healthy and fit becomes simple too!

- Weight tracker
Set up your weight goal and track your progress. See your results in real time — the progress you make is the best motivation!

And we’ve got so much more:

- Customized shopping lists to make your grocery shopping enjoyable;
- Courses and challenges to deepen your knowledge in weight loss, healthy eating, and more;
- At-home workouts designed to help you burn calories and boost metabolism;
- Water tracker to help you stay hydrated and have fun at the same time

Complete the quiz and create an account to enjoy all of Unimeal’s features.

Privacy Policy: https://unimeal.com/privacy-policy
Terms of use: https://unimeal.com/terms-of-service

Our app is an all-in-one tool for tracking intermittent fasting routines. It includes a fasting timer with a calendar view and progress rings, allowing users to choose from different protocols such as 13:11, 16:8, 18:6, 20:4, or OMAD. Users can take a quiz to determine their optimal fasting protocol and set custom start and end times for fasting periods. After completing a fast, the app provides an eating window tracker and options to pause or end the timer.

In addition, the app offers health tracking across three sections: overall statistics (weight, steps, calories), progress analysis, and parameter relationships. An integrated AI chat lets users ask real-time questions about fasting, nutrition, and health, while a library of articles and tips provides extra guidance. The app also integrates with Apple Health and other platforms, featuring reminders and widgets for a seamless user experience.
This application contains auto-renewable subscriptions and In-App Purchases.
